<title>FRANCE: HORSE RACING-PRIX DE LA FORET RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-PRIX DE LA FORET RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on Sunday of the group one</p>
<p>Prix de la Foret for two-year-olds, run over seven furlongs (1.4</p>
<p>km) at Longchamp.</p>
<p>1. A Magicman (Andreas Suborics)</p>
<p>2. Miesque's Son (Cash Asmussen)</p>
<p>3. Shaanxi (Olivier Peslier)</p>
<p>4. Zarannda (Gerald Mosse)</p>
<p>11 ran. Distances: head, three quarter of a length, a length</p>
<p>and a half.</p>
<p>Winner owned by Stall Dagobert and trained in Germany by</p>
<p>Hartmut Steguweit. Value to the winner $102,000.</p>
<p>Pari-mutuel (including one france stake): win 23.50; places</p>
<p>3.60, 1.60, 1.30. Dual Forecast 59.10.</p>
</text>
